    "updated_at": "2021-04-06T22:57:28Z",
    "body": "Probably for the same reason as `DocumentFragment`, you can't serialize a `document` either (except via `XMLSerializer` but this forces xhtml rather than html).\r\n\r\nThe [current proposal for declarative shadow dom](https://web.dev/declarative-shadow-dom/#serialization) contains a `.getInnerHTML(...)` function, so even if `.innerHTML` on `DocumentFragment`/`Document` is a web-compat issue, that could potentially be used instead.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
